  solution_summary: |
    (1) f(-1)=2, f(0)=1, f(1)=0. 치역={0,1,2}.
    (2) f(-1)=1, f(0)=1, f(1)=3. 치역={1,3}.
    (3) f(-1)=0, f(0)=-1, f(1)=0. 치역={-1,0}.
