  category_type: 유제
  problem_summary: |
    f(x)=2x-1, g(x)=-3x+4. (1) f∘h=g, (2) h∘f=g, (3) h∘g∘f=g 각각 h 구하기.
  solution_summary: |
    (1) 2h(x)-1=-3x+4 → h(x)=(-3x+5)/2.
    (2) h(2x-1)=-3x+4. t=2x-1 → x=(t+1)/2. h(t)=-3(t+1)/2+4=-3t/2+5/2 → h(x)=-3x/2+5/2.
    (3) g(f(x))=-3(2x-1)+4=-6x+7. h(-6x+7)=g(x)=-3x+4. t=-6x+7 → x=(7-t)/6. h(t)=-3(7-t)/6+4=t/2+1/2 → h(x)=(1/2)x+1/2.
  category: 미지 성분 h 구하기 3유형
  tier: star_4
